1
00:00:05,090 --> 00:00:09,020
Kelly is a very strong-willed person.

2
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:11,320
And if she didn't want to do something,

3
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,060
she didn't do it.

4
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:16,740
And one day I picked her up from school.

5
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:19,970
She was just arguing with me.

6
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:23,350
And she just kept on going and going.

7
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:25,890
And then I said,

8
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:28,520
you know how to push my buttons, don't you?

9
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,660
And she said,

10
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:33,890
mom, you show me a button and I'll push it.

11
00:00:33,890 --> 00:00:35,470
And then I said,

12
00:00:35,470 --> 00:00:39,420
I'll pull over and you're going to get out of my car.

13
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,960
And she said, I can't do that.

14
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:41,810
And I said, why?

15
00:00:41,810 --> 00:00:43,070
And she said,

16
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:44,590
because you have to take me home.

17
00:00:44,590 --> 00:00:48,860
And I said, I'll put, I'm going to let you get out and you can walk home.

18
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:49,510
And she said,

19
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:52,260
and if you do that, I'm going to call the police.

20
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:54,310
So, anyways, that's how it ended.

21
00:00:54,310 --> 00:00:57,420
I ended up leaving her in the car and taking her home.

22
00:00:57,420 --> 00:01:01,090
But she always argued with me about everything.

23
00:01:04,190 --> 00:01:06,660
When we would go to the coast

24
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:08,870
and we would walk along the cliffs,

25
00:01:08,870 --> 00:01:12,320
I would have to put like a leash on her

26
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:16,700
because she was so stubborn and she wouldn't want to go by herself,

27
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:19,760
but she would just take off and go.

28
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:23,810
So I always had to keep her in.

29
00:01:23,810 --> 00:01:27,690
So everybody said I was mean because I put a leash on her.

30
00:01:27,690 --> 00:01:32,130
I think we started going camping with Kelly when she was one.

31
00:01:32,130 --> 00:01:34,330
She was still in diapers

32
00:01:34,330 --> 00:01:36,830
and we took her everywhere

33
00:01:36,830 --> 00:01:39,550
and we'd go for two weeks at a time.

34
00:01:39,550 --> 00:01:43,000
And we have a backpack that we would put her in.

35
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,630
And so we were, went hiking all the time

36
00:01:46,630 --> 00:01:52,990
and on binky bottle patrol. whoever was behind her.

37
00:01:52,990 --> 00:01:56,120
So because she always had her binky and her bottle with her.

38
00:01:56,120 --> 00:02:05,790
So if she would lose it, oh, and her blankie. So somebody would always have to rescue them.

39
00:02:05,790 --> 00:02:07,960
Well, I remember Christmas.

40
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:14,180
I remember one of her Christmas that the neighbor was dressed up as Santa Claus.

41
00:02:14,180 --> 00:02:18,430
And when she went to bed, we had him come over.

42
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:21,340
And  kissed her on the cheek in bed,

43
00:02:21,340 --> 00:02:27,650
and then we took pictures of Santa Claus putting presents under the tree for her.

44
00:02:27,650 --> 00:02:30,530
So then when she was really excited,

45
00:02:30,530 --> 00:02:34,940
of course she put out the milk and the cookies for him, and they were gone.

46
00:02:34,940 --> 00:02:37,340
So she was happy that Santa came.

47
00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:38,430
So, yeah.

48
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:49,790
I think it was hard. I know when she was going off to college.

49
00:02:49,790 --> 00:02:54,400
Having her be gone like that for the first time.

50
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:57,380
And then she didn't come home.

51
00:02:57,380 --> 00:03:01,310
She went on to Europe for a while after college,

52
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:04,380
and then she met you.

53
00:03:04,380 --> 00:03:09,410
This interview ends by, you're here, you brought my daughter back home,

54
00:03:09,410 --> 00:03:15,100
and now I have two wonderful grandchildren and a wonderful son in law.

55
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:18,370
So, it makes me happy.
